<%- include('../partials/head') %>

<div class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Terms of service</h1>
    <p class="meta-updated">These terms cover use of this website and the order request process.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <% if (!complianceSignedOff) { %>
      <div class="note note-pending">
        <h3>Awaiting legal review</h3>
        <p>
          These terms describe how the software behaves. They must be reviewed and adopted by the licence
          holder's legal adviser before launch. Governing law and dispute resolution are left blank until the
          operating jurisdiction is confirmed.
        </p>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <h2>Who you are dealing with</h2>
    <p>
      This website is operated by <%= business.legalName %><%= hasRealFfl ? ', holder of Federal Firearms Licence ' + business.fflLicenceNumber : '' %>.
      References to <q>the shop</q> mean that business.
    </p>

    <h2>The catalogue is an invitation to treat</h2>
    <p>
      A listing on this site is not an offer to sell. Adding an item to an order request and submitting the
      form does not form a contract, does not reserve stock and does not take payment. A contract exists only
      when the shop confirms the order in writing after checking availability and eligibility.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy of listings</h2>
    <p>
      Specifications, images and prices come from the supplier stock record. Where a field is not held in
      that record the site leaves it out rather than estimating it. Errors do occur. Where a price or
      specification is wrong the shop may decline the order and will tell you why. Images are representative
      of the configuration and a specific unit may vary in markings or accessories.
    </p>

    <h2>Eligibility</h2>
    <p>
      You may only submit an order request if you are lawfully entitled to buy and possess the item where you
      live. See the <a href="/compliance">compliance notice</a>. Giving false information in the eligibility
      confirmation is a serious offence and the shop reports it where it is required to.
    </p>

    <h2>Prices</h2>
    <p>
      Prices are shown in United States dollars and cover the item only. Transfer fees, shipping and tax are
      quoted separately. Prices change without notice until an order is confirmed in writing.
    </p>

    <h2>Acceptable use of this site</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Do not attempt to access parts of the service you have not been given access to.</li>
      <li>Do not scrape, mirror or resell the catalogue.</li>
      <li>Do not submit forms through automated tooling. Rate limits are enforced and abusive addresses are blocked.</li>
      <li>Do not use the contact forms to send identity documents, licence numbers or payment details.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      Site design and code belong to the shop. GLOCK is a registered trademark of Glock Ges.m.b.H. Product
      photographs belong to their respective owners and are used to identify the items offered. This site is
      an independent dealer listing and is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Glock Ges.m.b.H.
    </p>

    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>
      The shop is responsible for supplying goods that match their description and for meeting its legal
      obligations as a licensed dealer. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot lawfully be
      limited. Safe storage, safe handling and lawful use of any item after transfer are the responsibility of
      the person who receives it.
    </p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <% if (jurisdictionPending) { %>
      <p class="meta-updated">
        Governing law and the courts with jurisdiction are stated here once the operating jurisdiction is
        confirmed. This field is intentionally not guessed.
      </p>
    <% } else { %>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the law of <%= jurisdiction.stateOrRegion %>, <%= jurisdiction.country %>,
        and the courts of that jurisdiction have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute.
      </p>
    <% } %>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms go through the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
